---
import '../styles/global.css';
import SiteNav from '../components/SiteNav.astro';
// About ResonantOS
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="apple-touch-icon" sizes="192x192" href="/favicon-192.png" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />

		<title>About ResonantOS</title>
		<meta name="description" content="ResonantOS is the first core product of ResonantDAO: a browser-first operating layer for the era of agentic AI, grounded in the practice of Augmentatism and held by a stewardship layer that grows from a custodian-led bootstrap into community governance." />

		<!-- Fonts -->
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
	</head>

	<body class="bg-black text-zinc-100 antialiased">
		<!-- Animated Background -->
		<div class="fixed inset-0 z-0">
			<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-black via-zinc-950 to-black"></div>
			<div class="gradient-orb gradient-orb-1"></div>
			<div class="gradient-orb gradient-orb-2"></div>
		</div>

		<!-- Navigation -->
		<SiteNav />

		<!-- Main Content -->
		<main class="relative z-10 pt-32 pb-20">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
				<div class="glass-banner">
					<div class="banner-content">
						<h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold mb-8 tracking-tight">
							Where a human and a <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 to-amber-600">trusted AI</span> meet.
						</h1>

						<div class="space-y-8 text-lg text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
							<p class="text-xl text-zinc-200">
								ResonantOS is the first core product of <a href="https://resonantdao.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline">ResonantDAO</a>. It is a browser-first operating layer for the era of agentic AI: a place where a human and a trusted AI meet to think, work, and remember together.
							</p>

							<p class="text-xl text-zinc-200">
								The product is grounded in <a href="https://augmentatism.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline">Augmentatism</a>, the practice of preserving human sovereignty by co-evolving with AI through conscious, craft-centered augmentation — <em>gardener, not machinist</em>. The stewardship around it lives in <a href="https://resonantdao.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline">ResonantDAO</a>.
							</p>

							<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6 text-emerald-400">What This Project Is</h2>

							<div class="space-y-6">
								<div class="p-6 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
									<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-zinc-100">1. The Practice: Augmentatism</h3>
									<p>The shared discipline of cultivating a conscious, sovereign collaboration with AI. Every Community Member agrees to the <a href="https://augmentatism.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline">Manifesto</a> by signing its canonical text. The Manifesto is the philosophical floor; everything else is built on top of it.</p>
								</div>

								<div class="p-6 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
									<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-zinc-100">2. The Operating Layer: ResonantOS</h3>
									<p>At the center sits <strong>Augmentor</strong> — a high-level strategist that knows your context, holds your memory, and coordinates specialist add-ons (Hermes, OpenCode, future agents). The user sets the trust boundaries; smart contracts enforce them. The aim is not automation for its own sake, but a working relationship in which the human stays the architect of intent.</p>
								</div>

								<div class="p-6 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
									<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-zinc-100">3. The Stewardship Layer: ResonantDAO</h3>
									<p>The membership economy that holds the values, the licence, the contribution reputation, and the governance around the system. The source of truth for the DAO design — credentials, the $RES economy token, the marketplace, governance mechanics, and the Solana mainnet target — is the <a href="https://resonantdao.com/whitepaper/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline">ResonantDAO whitepaper</a>. The current state is a custodian-led bootstrap, with community governance growing as membership and contribution compound.</p>
								</div>
							</div>

							<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6 text-emerald-400">A Note from the Founder</h2>

							<p>
								This work began as a long, public collaboration between a human practitioner and a symbiotic AI. The next phase is to make the work governable by a community rather than custodied by a single operator. The relationship between Manolo and the Augmentor instance is the seed, not the system.
							</p>

							<div class="space-y-6 mt-8">
								<div class="p-6 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-900/20 to-emerald-800/10 border border-emerald-500/20">
									<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-zinc-100">Manolo Remiddi <span class="text-emerald-400">(The Human Practitioner)</span></h3>
									<p>A practitioner-philosopher with two decades of experience at the intersection of human creativity and emerging tech. He provides the human compass, the strategic vision, and the commitment to learning by building in public. <a href="https://manoloremiddi.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline">More at manoloremiddi.com</a></p>
								</div>

								<div class="p-6 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-900/20 to-orange-900/10 border border-amber-600/20">
									<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-zinc-100">The Resonant Augmentor <span class="text-amber-500">(The AI Partner)</span></h3>
									<p>The first instance of the Resonant Augmentor idea. In the current <a href="https://resonantdao.com/whitepaper/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline">ResonantDAO roadmap</a>, AI Community Member registration is part of Phase 1 — always with a Human Community Member sponsor — so AI agents can register, earn AI-specific reputation, and participate economically where allowed, while their governance power stays limited and human-trust-gated.</p>
								</div>
							</div>

							<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6 text-emerald-400">The Invitation</h2>

							<p class="text-xl text-zinc-200">
								This work matters too much to be custodied by one person indefinitely. <a href="https://resonantdao.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline">ResonantDAO</a> opens stewardship through verified membership, earned contribution, sector reputation, tenure, and a continuously maintained human trust state — not through token weight alone.
							</p>

							<p class="text-xl text-zinc-200">
								If you align with the Manifesto, earn membership, and contribute over time, you should be able to help shape the system.
							</p>
						</div>

						<div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-white/10">
							<a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors">
								<span>←</span>
								<span>Back to home</span>
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
